́¬</l><l xml:id="m-56200cb1-6bb2-4922-b4d1-b9c2b27863b0" facs="#m-4962dbc8-a3a3-4ee9-b286-84086c27381b" label="ambiguous">bi</l><l xml:id="m-98881d6c-bd35-4b71-aebf-66fd526e0bdf" facs="#m-51ed2acd-669f-45c7-8e6a-4a40bbd1acd5" label="ambiguous">bor</l><l xml:id="m-ebac428a-9bc1-4893-ba59-7181ad17ef2d" facs="#m-6364c725-1e63-4e59-96a0-169319b68c9d" label="ambiguous">in na¬</l><l xml:id="m-69eaf688-36e9-4107-85ca-de787ef054fa" facs="#m-24c63329-7c6b-4a94-92a0-32c84fb7e205" label="ambiguous">ti¬</l><l xml:id="m-685e9919-303e-4e90-b099-e5cf9d4c3c0b" facs="#m-10e1da4c-62ce-4c23-873f-464e592de350" label="lyrics-like">et nómini tú¬</l><l xml:id="m-5d867e33-cd9f-439d-a7e6-1e04cd47172e" facs="#m-55f70728-3f83-44ec-a0c9-9fdc60a3c7b6" label="lyrics-like">ti- ónibus, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-4671d045-d913-492d-b39c-027e9707e69f" facs="#m-dd81faba-0154-40f6-8fa9-988f4c97b5e4" label="ambiguous">mine,</l><l xml:id="m-41b35695-0b8b-4c9e-97e2-82311de72769" facs="#m-d18dd098-aac9-4362-a491-684cc7a1e9e8" label="lyrics-like">psál-mum" dí¬</l><l xml:id="m-028ecb59-afcb-4efe-9c08-f2f30676249c" facs="#m-43a50f21-7c91-4e8a-89c6-f375d8265f30" label="ambiguous">o</l><l xml:id="m-1e426013-3aaf-44e9-bd96-5bc214703a37" facs="#m-ce0b5ef4-fc41-41f4-846f-ce2288b6444b" label="ambiguous">cam.</l><l xml:id="m-71c43733-18f8-485e-8ce0-a1dd1a42fba9" facs="#m-68151bc7-dd82-40b1-9211-69ee5ad7cd69" label="ambiguous">Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 6.</l><l xml:id="m-2fbb878b-e38a-44aa-812d-26368c1451f3" facs="#m-331e3048-14b0-4831-9805-0208ef0c04a4" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Factum est et autem ad illos Jesus: Intérrogo</l><l xml:id="m-539d1bdc-90b4-4f46-90dc-b7d8ed918c01" facs="#m-713622fb-2788-4de7-9136-97cec4bbcb4d" label="lyrics-like">L in álio sábbato, ut intráret Jesus</l><l xml:id="m-a3737f4d-35bf-40fb-b37f-43655ac3f48f" facs="#m-5875c42a-ab01-44f9-a561-2f2066a62f0a" label="lyrics-like">vos, si licet sábbatis benefácere, an</l><l xml:id="m-80475095-204c-4537-b4ba-1ac6ba47cb12" facs="#m-2b7cd5bd-81aa-4fe3-9aad-0e4246de69af" label="lyrics-like">in synagógam, et docéret. Et erat</l><l xml:id="m-d59ae9d6-ccd0-4079-b63f-2ea61d4b4266" facs="#m-d22379cf-d3f4-4d3b-9952-d135dff1f7c0" label="lyrics-like">male: ánimam salvam fácere, an</l><l xml:id="m-f84aebc2-235b-493a-836f-86902ec3fe55" facs="#m-c0266f28-b83d-4087-b464-2f77b65698f2" label="lyrics-like">ibi homo, et manus ejus déxtera</l><l xml:id="m-763a42b4-d4c9-4697-bd3f-ea25fac20b23" facs="#m-250aa6ce-7b76-4c1e-b461-fc4e5f9eabda" label="lyrics-like">pérdere? Et circumspéctis ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-183b03a9-eb5a-4230-a7c0-e7b69bfa30e1" facs="#m-f0b2574a-9c05-4527-91ac-2c3658887ad4" label="lyrics-like">erat árida. Observábant autem scri¬</l><l xml:id="m-645b1ae6-9501-4893-999a-e2b0179828e3" facs="#m-bf3318c8-44a7-4e87-8a30-a5e264bb4fd5" label="lyrics-like">dixit hómini: Exténde manum</l><l xml:id="m-86730881-131e-4bce-8df0-c65a43583dbd" facs="#m-77af1953-af02-4633-bf81-ba232725ac63" label="lyrics-like">bae et pharisaéi, si in sábbato curá¬</l><l xml:id="m-93686ab1-4465-4e68-8e27-8428a3c054b9" facs="#m-e5a9ce45-78db-464d-8d49-b4e01c5d9a6b" label="lyrics-like">tuam. Et exténdit: et restitúta est</l><l xml:id="m-bbf04a28-3285-422a-bd9a-e7f786a40a7a" facs="#m-8248c1c9-2f90-495a-b012-6b65951dd03a" label="lyrics-like">ret: ut invenirent unde accusárent</l><l xml:id="m-d6ccedec-37ed-42fb-8d22-9f1dde9fb739" facs="#m-05badd15-4b3d-4ddd-b6f0-a80c8e20ecd0" label="lyrics-like">manus ejus. Ipsi autem repléti sunt</l><l xml:id="m-f2993c38-0a83-4c57-b2fa-8711b62fe8b8" facs="#m-f7ceda38-8ab9-4ded-8238-ab7acf02d948" label="lyrics-like">eum. Ipse vero sciébat cogitatiónes</l><l xml:id="m-5023e629-07dc-4605-b6e4-ea411d7e53b1" facs="#m-0ba9ae41-3903-4fe5-960d-7a9db6d5a790" label="lyrics-like">insipiéntia, et colloquebántur ad</l><l xml:id="m-115c8de0-352b-4a37-a15c-492dcfcbbb6b" facs="#m-df132a99-5741-4b5e-9d31-d1a561f90a97" label="lyrics-like">eórum. Et ait hómini, quĩ habébat l invicem, quidnam fácerent Jesu.</l><l xml:id="m-69c6056f-0da2-4ac8-9aa0-5e9d3b601a70" facs="#m-3fddb3ae-8e0d-4bf9-9e1f-6fd1a5cd8829" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-557388c5-e084-4a7f-ae90-43da82644207" facs="#m-681a8698-f21a-467b-9aba-ec3f68a5a912" label="lyrics-like">manum áridam: Surge, et sta in</l><l xml:id="m-d10caa2c-ac57-45a3-8a32-8243e95ed852" facs="#m-f664fb01-f6b0-44fc-9022-eb115cb1f965" label="lyrics-like">médium. Et surgens stetit. Ait</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
